            <p>Maintain clean streets and public places.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Education</h3>
            <p>Provide educational support to children.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Social Awareness</h3>
            <p>Spread awareness about health and hygiene.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

